    description: "The Mitsubishi A5M2 (Type 96) was an all-metal monoplane carrier fighter that entered Japanese Navy service in 1937 — the first monoplane carrier fighter in the world to see combat — and was highly manoeuvrable. In game it carries two forward-firing 7.7 mm Type 97 machine guns.",
