    description: "The Mitsubishi A6M2 Zero (Model 21) was a long-range carrier fighter that entered Japanese Navy service in 1940. Its very low wing loading gave it outstanding dogfight agility and its range was exceptional, but protection was minimal. In game it carries two forward-firing 20 mm Type 99 cannon and two forward-firing 7.7 mm Type 97 machine guns.",
    author: "",
    links: [
      {
        name: "Wikipedia — Mitsubishi A6M Zero",
        url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitsubishi%20A6M%20Zero",
