    description: "HMS Hood was the last battlecruiser completed for the Royal Navy and, for two decades, one of the world's most famous warships. Her high speed and imposing appearance made her a symbol of British sea power. Bismarck and Prinz Eugen engaged her in the Denmark Strait, where a magazine explosion destroyed her.",
    author: "TZoli",
    links: [
      {
        name: "Wikipedia — Hood",
