        label: "Torpedo Bombers",
        value: "24× TBF-1",
      },
      {
        label: "Dive Bombers",
        value: "32× SB2C-4",
      },
    ],
    description: "Illinois is a fictional completion of the unbuilt Iowa-class BB-65 based on the U.S. Navy's 1942 S-511-54 carrier-conversion study. The proposal had an approximately 263-by-33-metre flight deck, two elevators, and one catapult, but was rejected because it carried fewer aircraft and cost more than a new Essex-class carrier.",
    author: "TZoli",
