    description: "Kaga began as a Tosa-class battleship and was converted into an aircraft carrier after the Washington Naval Treaty. A major reconstruction replaced her original multi-level flight decks and made her one of Japan's principal fleet carriers. She took part in the Pearl Harbor attack and was fatally bombed at Midway.",
