    description: "HMS Tiger was the last battlecruiser completed for the Royal Navy before the First World War. Her eight 13.5-inch guns and balanced layout reflected lessons from earlier battlecruisers. She fought at Dogger Bank and Jutland, later served as a training ship, and was scrapped under interwar naval treaty limits.",
