    description: "The British 24.5-inch (622 mm) single fixed torpedo tube, mounted one to each beam of the Nelson-class battleships and firing the 24.5-inch Mark I torpedo. The Nelsons were the only ships to carry this torpedo, and HMS Rodney fired them at the Bismarck.",
