    description: "USS West Virginia (BB-48) was the third completed Colorado-class battleship and entered service in 1923. Sunk in shallow water by torpedoes and bombs at Pearl Harbor, she was salvaged and comprehensively rebuilt with a tower superstructure, torpedo bulges, radar, and twin 5-inch/38 dual-purpose mounts; the game depicts her final 1945 configuration. After returning to action, her radar-directed battery led the American battle line at Surigao Strait, and she later supported the Lingayen Gulf, Iwo Jima, and Okinawa campaigns before entering Tokyo Bay after Japan's surrender. She earned five battle stars during the Second World War.",
