        label: "Main Battery",
        value: "4x1 120mm/45",
      },
      {
        label: "Torpedoes",
        value: "3x2 533mm",
      },
    ],
    description: "The Minekaze class were first-class destroyers built for the Imperial Japanese Navy under the 8-4 Fleet Program between 1917 and 1920, serving as fast escorts for the battlecruiser squadrons and providing the hull and machinery layout that the following Kamikaze, Mutsuki and Wakatake classes reused. By the Pacific War they had been relegated to second-line duties such as patrol, transport and kaiten carrier, and eleven of the fifteen were lost. The ship's layout and armament follow tzoli's drawing.",
    author: "Tzoli",
    links: [
      {
        name: "Minekaze Class Destroyer",
        url: "https://www.deviantart.com/tzoli/art/Minekaze-Class-Destroyer-1218919925",
