    description: "The Ju 87 B-1 was the first mass-produced Stuka, joining the Luftwaffe in 1938; the Jericho-Trompete sirens on its wings made the dive a weapon of psychological warfare. A Jumo 211 powered two 7.92mm MG 17 guns in the wings, one MG 15 aft, a 250 kg centreline bomb and four 50 kg bombs. Poland, France and Britain exposed its slow speed and weak defences.",
    author: "Unknown",
    links: [
