        value: "1 x 225kg",
      },
    ],
    description: "The Loire-Nieuport LN 401 was a single-seat carrier dive bomber accepted by the French Navy in 1939. Its inverted-gull wing and Hispano-Suiza 12Xcrs engine gave a maximum speed of about 380 km/h. Fixed armament comprised one 20mm HS.404 cannon and two 7.5mm Darne machine guns, while the centreline rack carried one 225 kg bomb. It suffered heavy losses attacking German columns during the 1940 Battle of France and is represented in game as a dive bomber.",
    author: "Unknown",
    links: [
