      {
        label: "Bombs (Level Bombing)",
        value: "4 x 75kg",
      },
    ],
    description: "The Bréguet 521 Bizerte was a three-engine maritime reconnaissance flying boat introduced by the French Navy in 1935. Its sesquiplane layout and central boat hull supported long-range fleet search, patrol and anti-submarine duties. Three 900 hp Gnome-Rhône 14Kirs engines gave a maximum speed of about 243 km/h and a normal cruising range of about 2,100 km. In the game it is represented as a level bomber carrying five 7.5mm Darne machine guns and four 75 kg bombs.",
    author: "Unknown",
    links: [
