      {
        label: "Bombs (Dive Bombing)",
        value: "2 x 1000kg",
      },
    ],
    description: "The Nord 1500 Noréclair was a French twin-engined carrier attack aircraft prototype first flown in 1949. Two 1,600 hp Gnome-Rhône 14R piston engines gave a maximum speed of about 540 km/h and a practical range of about 3,450 km. It could carry either one 450mm aerial torpedo or 2,000 kg of bombs, with two 20mm MG 151 cannon in the wings and two more in a tail turret. The type did not enter series production. In game it is represented as a dive attack aircraft using the higher-damage 2 x 1000 kg bomb load.",
    author: "Unknown",
    links: [
      {
        name: "Wikipedia - Nord 1500 Noréclair",
