    "description": "The Reggiane Re.2005 Sagittario entered service in 1943 with a Fiat-built DB 605 engine and ranks among the finest Italian piston fighters of the war. Maximum speed was about 628 km/h with an internal-fuel range of 980 km. In game it is a fighter armed with two 12.7 mm nose machine guns and three 20 mm MG 151/20 cannon, one in the hub and two in the wings; no bombs are configured.",
