    "description": "The Fiat BR.20 Cicogna was a twin-engined medium bomber that entered service in 1936, recognised by its glazed nose and twin tail. It flew with the Regia Aeronautica over Britain and the Balkans early in the war. Maximum speed was about 440 km/h with a range of 2,750 km. In game it is a level bomber armed with three 12.7 mm machine guns and three 500 kg bombs.",
