    "description": "The Yak-1 first flew in 1940 and became the backbone of the Soviet fighter force in 1941. Maximum speed was about 571 km/h with a range of 700 km. Early production aircraft carried one 20mm ShVAK firing through the propeller hub and two synchronized 7.62mm ShKAS in the nose, which is the fit configured here. In game it is treated as a fighter; bomb racks are not configured and are not listed here.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "links": [
      {
        "name": "Wikipedia — Yak-1",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yakovlev_Yak-1",
      },
