    ],
    "description": "The Yak-3 entered service in 1944 as a lightened dogfighter. Its very high power-to-weight ratio let it out-turn and out-climb contemporary German fighters at low altitude, with a maximum speed of 646 km/h, although range was only about 550 km. Armament was one 20mm ShVAK through the propeller hub and two synchronized 12.7mm UBS in the nose. In game it is treated as a fighter; bomb racks are not configured and are not listed here.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "links": [
