    "description": "The Beriev Be-4 (KOR-2) was a catapult-launched shipboard reconnaissance flying boat that entered service in 1942, operating from cruiser and battleship catapults and recovering on the water. Maximum speed was about 356 km/h with a range of some 1,150 km, a length of 10.50 m and a span of 12.00 m. Its only armament was a single trainable 7.62mm ShKAS in the rear cockpit. In game it is treated as a reconnaissance flying boat; bomb racks are not configured and are not listed here.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "links": [
