    "description": "The Beriev MBR-2 was a shore-based long-range reconnaissance flying boat of the 1930s. The later MBR-2bis production variant introduced the AM-34NB engine, giving a maximum speed of 275 km/h and a range of up to 1,600 km, with a length of 13.50 m and a span of 19.00 m. Armament was one 7.62mm PV-1 in the bow and one 7.62mm ShKAS in a dorsal turret. In game it is treated as a reconnaissance flying boat; bomb racks are not configured and are not listed here.",
