    "description": "The I-15 was a Polikarpov biplane fighter that first flew in 1933 and reached 367 km/h with a range of 510 km. Four 7.62mm PV-1 machine guns were mounted in the upper wing and fuselage. It was a mainstay in Spain and at Khalkhin Gol but was obsolete by 1941. In game it is treated as a fighter; bomb racks are not configured and are not listed here.",
